#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "June 2026 {#june-2026}"
msgstr "Hunyo 2026 {#june-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introducing [Qiskit Paulice](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice): a new addon that integrates low-overhead quantum error detection into quantum circuits to boost the fidelity of measured distributions. It provides single-shot access to the quantum state and so can be used in both sampling-based and expectation value-based workflows. Check out the [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-paulice) and [documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice) for how to get started today.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakilala ang [Qiskit Paulice](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice): isang bagong addon na nagsasama ng mababang-overhead na quantum error detection sa mga quantum circuit para mapahusay ang fidelity ng mga sinukat na distribution. Nagbibigay ito ng single-shot na access sa quantum state kaya magagamit ito sa parehong sampling-based at expectation value-based na mga workflow. Tingnan ang [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-paulice) at [dokumentasyon](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice) para sa kung paano magsimula ngayon.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Previous updates {#previous-updates}"
msgstr "Mga nakaraang update {#previous-updates}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We recently released two new addons that use classical resources to reduce the quantum resources needed for error mitigation:\n"
msgstr "Kamakailan lang kaming naglabas ng dalawang bagong addon na gumagamit ng mga classical resource para bawasan ang mga quantum resource na kailangan para sa error mitigation:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Propagated noise absorption (PNA)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/) is a technique for mitigating errors in expectation values by absorbing the inverses of the learned noise channels into observables using Pauli propagation. \n"
msgstr "Ang [Propagated noise absorption (PNA)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-pna/) ay isang teknik para mabawasan ang mga error sa expectation values sa pamamagitan ng pag-absorb ng mga inverse ng mga natutunang noise channel sa mga observable gamit ang Pauli propagation. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Shaded lightcones (SLC)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) addon uses classical simulations to more tightly bound the sensitivity to errors throughout the circuit. This allows for more efficient, targeted applications of Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) with reduced variance.\n"
msgstr "Ginagamit ng [Shaded lightcones (SLC)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) addon ang classical simulations para mas mahigpit na i-bound ang sensitivity sa mga error sa buong circuit. Nagpapahintulot ito para sa mas episyente, targeted na aplikasyon ng Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) na may mas kaunting variance.\n"
